@MeetSpace.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:8000

### Create booking
POST {{MeetSpace.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

### Get all rooms
GET {{MeetSpace.Api_HostAddress}}/api/rooms
Accept: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "bookedBy": "John Doe",
  "title": "Veckomöte",
  "startTime": "2026-10-15T09:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-10-15T10:00:00"
}

